[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身处一个安静的家。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经忘了多久没有说过“我回来了”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有“你回来了”……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以及“早上好”……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"包括“我开动了”……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和“我吃好了”……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这个家里，这些话只会徒增寂寞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个人做饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要点声音，就打开电视。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不在乎节目的内容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是想听听人的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去学校就能和朋友们交谈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那让我十分开心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以相对的，回到家后――……就寂寞万分……"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做了个怪梦……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"内容记不太清了，不过感觉是个郁闷的梦。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？羽未？这么早有什么事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……体操……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“体操……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对哦。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从今天起就开始广播体操了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未似乎很是期待，所以一大早就来叫我起床了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"强忍着困意，前往了会场。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是在一个不算大的神社的院落里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孩子们已经聚集起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"零零星星还有几个监护人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这岛上原来也有这么多孩子啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“小朋友们！准备好了吗！开始咯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"孩子们","text":"“噢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“声音太小了！开始咯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"孩子们","text":"“噢!!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“第一节！横隔膜振动！乌拉啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"孩子们","text":"“乌拉啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“乌…乌拉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“第二节！心肺机能强化！屏住一秒呼吸露出真挚目光！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……群星孤独……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉和我认知中的广播体操差别很大。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15515"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“乌拉啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未在我身旁做着这样的体操。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？你居然会这个？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……已经预习过了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝我竖起了大拇指。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也是，我虽然是第一次来这里，但羽未可能去年或者以前也来过这座岛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“那边不要闲聊！认真做操！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“别小看了广播体操！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好凶!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，根本就没有用到广播啊……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“好了，来我这里盖章！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"做完操后，他在我们的卡片上盖了章。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“这是参与奖。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉，这是？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"盖章的同时，还给了我一只手掌大小的虾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇!؟还在动啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这只虾还活着……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未也拿到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此，确实是不同凡响的广播体操。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总算明白了镜子阿姨所说的意思。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"广播体操结束后，回到家中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时间还早着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天一天才刚刚开始。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，这些虾要怎么办？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在餐桌上的盘子里活蹦乱跳着。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“早餐。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要吃掉吗？怎么吃？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见我有些不解，羽未慢慢地抓住一只虾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后用双手握住……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……等…你要做什……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猛地一扯……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “呀啊啊啊啊啊！” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把活虾的头拧下来了！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11617"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“出什么事了，发出那么大声的惨叫？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨，羽未……羽未她把虾……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哇喔，这是在广播体操拿到的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我也可以要一只吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……OK。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“那就趁还活蹦乱跳的时候…”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猛地一扯……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “呀啊啊啊啊啊！” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨也把虾头拧下来了！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？怎么回事啊？为什么要这么凶残呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……生吃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“拧掉头后，还要把脚和壳去掉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“然后就是这里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“将在身体断面的虾线扯掉后，就可以美味享用了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"软弹且色泽新鲜的虾身。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是……它还在抽动着…哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“生吃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未剥完壳后，一脸得意地把虾展示给我看。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“好了，羽依里也试试吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？不行的……哪能把活虾的头拧下来呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……这个给你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看见我有些打退堂鼓，羽未就将刚才剥好的虾递给了我。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……能吃吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢，剥成这样的肯定就能吃了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽未，不可以哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚准备伸手去接就被指责了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“吃掉它，就相当于收下它的生命。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11574"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“知晓生命的分量是很重要的事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃不……这个原理我是知道的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是，一般不都是去买现成的鸡肉和猪肉之类的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“咦？活鸡和活猪也有的哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不好……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这对话再继续下去，恐怕会演变成不可挽回的局面……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请再次指导如何处理活虾。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了良心的安宁，无奈我只好抓起了一只活虾。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一天，我学到了生命的分量及其美味。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又甜又软，十分好吃。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"饭后――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“镜子阿姨，今天的仓库整理……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“还不用，你还是先歇着吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又被一口回绝了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真的会有需要我的时候吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我究竟是来做什么的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是不制定一个计划的话，我会无聊成疾的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之现在只想家里有点声响，于是打开了电视。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……今天…不去…外面？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未少有地主动发问。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你有什么想去的地方吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……还是算了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么意思啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是自己来问的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15558"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，感觉她想让我带她去某个地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是现在又给人一种希望别人向她搭话的感觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是难懂的年纪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过想想，如果她真的有想去的地方的话，她自己也会去的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且我来这里也不是专门来照顾小孩的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边留意着羽未，同时将注意力放回到电视上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而，也并没有什么想看的节目。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……呼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也有早起做广播体操的原因，于是现在渐渐有些困了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15557"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未好像在看着我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是…我好困……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然已经睡着了，但脑子还是清醒的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"据说在快速眼动睡眠的时候容易做梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以……这是一个梦吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i28"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15895"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘怎么了吗？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘噢噢。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘你回来啦。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15812"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘我回来了啦。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15809"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘你刚才在说话吧。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘没……’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15798"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘是在自言自语吗？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘不，是它。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15809"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘……摩托车。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘你在和摩托车说话吗？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘不、不是的。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘是和站在摩托车前的人在说话。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘……唉？’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘没人呀。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15824"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘请不要说怪话。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15915"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘哇，吓我一跳。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15977"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘真的有别人在吗？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"‘没人的，放心。’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15991"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"‘是吗……’"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i499"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"醒了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又梦见羽未了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而梦中的羽未，果然和我所认识的羽未不同。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然年幼但却很懂事，不知何故总感觉她和我保持着距离，而且性格有点带刺……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么会多次梦见那样的羽未呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……心愿？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“心中希望羽未变成那个样子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就表明……”"},{"op":"callScene","scene":417,"target":10},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":271,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"goto","target":1063},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":274,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"set","variable":6001,"value":0},{"op":"goto","target":279},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":277,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"set","variable":6001,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":279},{"op":"goto","target":279},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"这就是……爱？","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"平行世界在入侵？","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":285,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“老是梦见羽未，原来是这个原因吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“年龄的差距不是问题……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“血系在堂兄弟姐妹以外的话也可以结婚……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“The·光源氏计划……”"},{"op":"goto","target":290},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":290,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在我沉睡的期间，从另一个世界发起了入侵吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那这样一来……羽未有危险！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会被异世界的羽未所替代！”"},{"op":"goto","target":290},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉，我在说些什么呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“应该是累了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明什么都没做。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"丢人的一面被她看见了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……肚子饿了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？哦哦，已经这个时间了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了看时间已经是正午了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以为只是打了个盹，没想到睡了这么久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有什么想吃的东西吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“又是炒饭吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，今天就让我一雪前耻。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，来尝尝我的一雪前耻炒饭吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将盛着炒饭的盘子放在羽未面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"香味十足。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"卖相也不算差。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和昨天的比起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嚼嚼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天的如何？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……八分。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只提升了一分。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15363"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我不吃了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又不肯吃了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11599"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀，羽依里做了午饭吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是好像不合羽未的口味。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“可以让我也尝尝吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然无妨，只是我不推荐哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“看起来这么香，一定没事的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨毫不犹豫，舀了一勺炒饭往嘴里送去。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11599"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀，挺好吃的呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？真的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“嗯，就像我自己做的一样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后我立马转身面向正在看着电视的羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，对不起，让你吃了这么可怕的炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未向我竖起拇指，表示不用担心。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吃完了这顿令人心灵受挫的午饭后，又无事可做了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨也吃完就回仓库去了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而羽未则露着肚皮，在电风扇前睡着午觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说来我好像听说，过开着电扇睡觉会死人的。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唔～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"娇小的身体微微一颤。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是一直顶着风吹，有些着凉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"姑且还是拿了块毛毯盖在了她肚子上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微想了想。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仓库的整理工作，感觉暂时还不会轮到我出场。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那这段空闲时间要怎么打发呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算是一件小事也好，想要先给自己立一个目标。"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"交个女朋友","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"交个好朋友","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"做菜","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":383,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，交个女朋友吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在远离家乡的这个夏天，就忘掉一切阻碍，全心为爱而活吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一定有愿意接受我的女生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是暑假一结束就要回去了，交个女朋友来干嘛呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"异地恋是绝对办不到的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那目前……一个显而易见的目标……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是炒饭了吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":115,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":394},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":393,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，交个好朋友吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在远离家乡的这个夏天，就忘掉一切阻碍，全心缔结友谊吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最好是能陪我一起瞎胡闹的那种。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是暑假一结束就要回去了，交个好朋友来干嘛呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然都说在异乡做的傻事将不为人知，但却无法从记忆中抹消掉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那目前……一个显而易见的目标……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是炒饭了吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":116,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":394},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对，就是炒饭了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"把手艺提升到能够做出让羽未赞不绝口的炒饭吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那为此应该要怎么做呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很遗憾的是我完全没做过饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"外行人就算自己反复尝试，也只是徒增奇葩食物而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且今天早上还学习了生命的宝贵，所以不能浪费食物。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这时候，就只能向人请教了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这才是最快的方法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"向谁请教呢……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“找着谁算谁吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拿起了摩托的钥匙。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“于是乎，我想请你教我炒饭好吃的诀窍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10227"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉？为什么要找我？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为我看好你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10205"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不是，你对我很了解吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说不上缘由，只感觉你是会做菜的那一类。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且穿围裙应该很好看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦……是、是吗？不过也是，我其实常被人说是居家型的～”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10194"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10392"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“炒饭自然不在话下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢！那真是可靠万分。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果可以的话，希望你能实操示范一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉؟!为了你专程穿上围裙做菜……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那……那不就代表……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10370"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我才是你的甜点吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……抱歉，我真的很难理解为什么你的脑回路会以超音速转变为花痴模式。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10218"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哈……！没什么，当我没说吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10210"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好了，是问炒饭的诀窍是吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10213"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过嘛，我也只能教你一些基础的东西哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就足够了，拜托。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10416"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那首先准备一口中式炒锅。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我只有平底锅。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10290"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那就死心吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不不，我是希望你给我一些关于调味的建议。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10208"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你别小看了炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是冷漠。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":555,"value":["==",["v",115],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，换个话题吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10227"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10228"},{"op":"image","layer":1539,"image":"i10229"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你怎么看待异地恋？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……哈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在盛夏熊熊燃烧的热恋……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我觉得只要有那份余温，就能跨越一切距离障碍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10309"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呃……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10286"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“莫非我……正在被追…？”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"正是如此","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"你已经……是我的女人了吧？","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"那是错觉","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":511,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“正是如此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10299"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为是仲夏。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以……就尝试着大胆一些。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“平时说不出口的话……一不小心就脱口而出了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10286"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是…是的哦…毕竟是夏天呢…”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10255"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“会不经意间说出…真心话之类的呢…”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，脱口而出的话……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不带半点真心。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10227"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“夏日玩笑而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你～……这～…个～…人～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说这种话觉得很开心吗！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10163"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为是夏天嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“滚啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10166"},{"op":"goto","target":554},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":539,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你已经……是我的女人了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10309"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别装了，我都知道的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你的目光一直注视着我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10286"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“突然间…瞎说…瞎说些什么呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一招壁咚按上去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……别说了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10371"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我明白的，你没了我是活不哈去的……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10311"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……吃螺丝了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“才没七螺丝……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10226"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“又吃螺丝了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“才没七螺丝!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10205"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“边逃还继续吃螺丝؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"讨厌啦――――！好丢人啊――――！"},{"op":"goto","target":554},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":554,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是错觉。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说得这么直白感觉有点受伤……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那是你想被我追咯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不，完全不想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说得这么直白感觉心灵有点受伤。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10130"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……你真的不是在追我吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇，你单纯得令人担忧。”"},{"op":"goto","target":554},{"op":"goto","target":555},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“炒饭？多多少少还是会做的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是嘛，那可真是可靠啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“炒饭就是为男人而生的嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“首先把衣服脱掉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这步可以省略。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“唉？但是甩锅的时候袖子不会碍事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“裸体做饭根本就不卫生吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那裸身围裙呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“另当别论。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人点点头，笑容满面地碰拳示意。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那关于炒饭的方法嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“首先要准备一口中式炒锅。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃，我只有平底锅。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那不行的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不能靠调味来弥补弥补吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“用平底锅就不是炒饭了是烤米饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不一样吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“可别小瞧了炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的……”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":628,"value":["==",["v",116],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我换个话题吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们俩……那啥……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是朋友…的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那还用说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“我们相遇，目光相对，肌肤相碰之后，当然就已经是朋友了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我记忆里并没有最后一项。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我问你……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i219"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12142"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……我们能成为挚友吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12175"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12157"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“……挚友吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“感觉说出口后……会好难为情啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12169"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“当然了，我并不是反感哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“只是，对了…只是有些害羞。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“其实我也有些害羞。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12145"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嘻嘻……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈哈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个男人，脸泛红霞地相互凝望着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"气氛感觉有些奇妙。"},{"op":"goto","target":628},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i21"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15082"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“首先一大前提……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可没有中式炒锅哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15086"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“……那你打算做什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不就是炒饭嘛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“那就先把装备凑齐了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么这岛上的人对炒饭这么严格啊。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":705,"value":["==",["v",116],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我换个话题吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15082"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“怎么了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们俩……是朋友吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15078"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“朋友……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦……不是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15086"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“这个问题不好回答呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15082"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“什么叫做朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我自己并没有对这个词下过定义。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不过……这样说吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15151"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你看这枚小小的乒乓球……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“如果有通过乒乓球(战斗)而建立起来的关系的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“那应该就能称之为宿敌(挚友)了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15093"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“来一局？”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"来吧","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"不来了","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":691,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“行吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就让你认可我这位宿敌(挚友)吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“眼神不错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15116"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我来了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i21"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15096"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“真是有意义的一段时间。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“通过乒乓球，我感觉我对你这个人有了一定认识。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15078"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我们……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15077"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“是宿敌(挚友)。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有力地握住了彼此的手。"},{"op":"goto","target":704},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":704,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不了，我今天还有事就算了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15072"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“等你有兴趣了随时来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15068"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“我等着你……挚友。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天善……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15070"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“呵……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然觉得好开心。"},{"op":"goto","target":704},{"op":"goto","target":705},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好了，接下来还剩谁能求教的呢……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i84"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的就不能想办法用平底锅炒吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎么突然就跪下了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我已经没有退路了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“用平底锅炒饭吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原本的话这个令人厌恶至极的提议。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我之前就在想了，这个岛上的居民是不是讨厌平底锅啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“煎荷包蛋需要平底锅。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那炒饭的话……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“炒饭最重要的是热量。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“就算是平底锅，只要加热到极限也能有所作为吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦哦，原来如此！终于得到一条有用的情报了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“加热到锅的握柄都烫手为止。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……那我该怎么炒呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“裹个毛巾或者戴个手套不就行了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那调味有没有什么诀窍呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“调味的话每个人的口味不一样不能一概而论。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过嘛……嗯，在我的记忆中的话……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“白羽的炒饭是最好吃的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽的炒饭？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“她家以前是开食堂的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“就是举办欢迎会的那家食堂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦，是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“白羽的炒饭，继承了那家店的味道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“如果真的想做炒饭的话，就去问白羽吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“多谢，帮大忙了。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":800,"value":["==",["v",115],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我换个话题吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我其实想交个女朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“为什么要对我说？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为我想要女朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11718"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你在追我吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你觉得呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“这个嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“如果是认真的――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗滋――！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噗哇！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……我就开枪。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“如果是开玩笑的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗滋――！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃噗啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……照样开枪。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以，建议你开口前慎重考虑。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等！开枪了！你已经开过枪了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那是预付。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说吧，玩笑还是认真。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……我是……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗滋――！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"直到把水枪的水都射空了才罢休。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然饱受了摧残，但好歹也获得了有用的情报。"},{"op":"goto","target":801},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经是迄今为止最有用的情报了。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接下来只要找到白羽，就万事大吉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了找到白羽，骑着摩托从西跑到东。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又从北寻到南……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"绕着岛跑了一圈……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而始终是找不到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也不在泳池啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第一次遇见她是在夜晚的泳池。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细一想，还没有和她正常地交谈过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算遇见了，她又会教我做炒饭吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会不会又挨一句岛骂之后转身逃跑啊……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“算了，还是找到人再说吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之先找再说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也只有这个办法了。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i63"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎～…”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"结果在岛上找了整整一天，也没遇到白羽。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……你去哪里了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？哦哦，去找了一下白羽。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“求婚？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的，想请她教我做炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15504"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“喔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“据野美希所说，她的炒饭是岛上最好吃的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“那好期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对吧！我一定会让你赞不绝口的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未少有地露出了兴奋的表情，两眼还放着光。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"晚饭后――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从电视里传出来恐怖的音乐。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是夏季惯例的灵异视频特辑。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15431"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"电视的画质模糊，一看就是恐怖影像，羽未看得一脸严肃。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"电视","text":"‘各位看明白了吗？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢，羽未，鬼要出来咯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呀!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未慌慌忙忙地跑去了屋子的角落。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15420"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……瑟瑟发抖。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在房间角落抱着坐垫缩成一团。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有那么害怕吗？这些都是假的啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……不、不要……小瞧了诅咒。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？别说这些吓唬人的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连我都害怕起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"电视","text":"‘那让我们再来看一遍吧。’"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15438"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……瑟瑟发抖。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未抱着坐垫将脸埋在里面浑身发着抖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在如果大吼一声她估计会吓一跳吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"喊一声","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"还是老实点吧","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":893,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “咿呀啊啊啊啊啊啊!!!” "},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15343"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊!!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然猜到她会吓一跳，但是没想到她反应这么大。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边惨叫着一边在屋里跑来跑去的羽未。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还哭了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起对不起，我真没想到你会这么怕。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15569"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“～～～～～～～!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15525"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰砰砰！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"边哭还边用小拳拳捶我的背。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"舒适的触感以及罪恶感，不可思议般地感受到了一阵满足。"},{"op":"goto","target":906},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吓唬正在害怕的女生，真不是成年人该做的事呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，我本来就不是成年人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是安静地看重播镜头吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"画面中出现了像是男子面容的影子。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15342"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊啊啊啊啊؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未突然间叫了起来，连我也跟着吓了一跳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还以为她用坐垫捂着脸，原来她好像透过缝隙还在看着呢。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15362"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“～～～～～～～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这下子整个脸都埋进了坐垫里，缩成了一团。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是我拍了拍她瑟瑟发抖的后背。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一夜，久久难以入睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚一睡着就醒过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后反复这个过程。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在几度醒来之后，突感感觉到枕边有气息。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……气息？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猛地睁开眼。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i75"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"؟؟؟","text":"“小…小…”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i263"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15486"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……!!!!!!!”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i75"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“小便……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼，原来是羽未啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还以为是闹鬼了呢，一时还真慌了神。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉？小便？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15482"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了，一个人不敢去？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“厕所，害怕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为看了灵异节目吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也难怪，毕竟是小孩子嘛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“行行行，马上带你去，你忍着点哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i64"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱……嘎吱……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"踩着陈旧的地板，嘎吱嘎吱作响。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这其实还蛮恐怖的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未走在一旁还紧紧地搂着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的体温还有点暖和。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果我孤身一人的话或许也会害怕。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":967,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……各位看明白了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小声地嘟哝了一句。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15523"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“!!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15526"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰砰砰！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小拳拳捶得很是舒服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“开玩笑的啦，抱歉抱歉。我闭嘴就是了。”"},{"op":"goto","target":967},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一言不发地走着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吧唧……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呀……!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脚底一阵恶心的触感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"踩到什么东西了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"估计是虫子之类的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太黑了也看不清……不，还是看不清的好。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":984,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而羽未却一脸怨恨地瞪了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"估计是以为我又想吓唬她吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不，没事的没事的。好了，我们快走吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……到底踩到什么了呢……"},{"op":"goto","target":984},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"带她到了厕所，总算让她把问题解决了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这下能睡得安稳了吧，晚安。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“晚安。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i75"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到房间，再次钻进被窝里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一阵轻微地摩擦声……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢噢!؟有东西进被子了!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有鬼!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15577"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼，原来是羽未啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15580"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我要睡这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但这里不是你的床啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“回自己房间睡你自己床去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15341"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呼……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂！别装睡！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15437"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15443"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我一个人睡不着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么啊？害怕吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15437"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“（点头）”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是因为害怕不想一个人睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不要像小孩子一样撒娇使性啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，她本来就是小孩子嘛。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15583"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我话还没落音，她真的就开始昏昏欲睡了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂喂，你真的要在这里睡吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……呼……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次真是睡着的呼吸声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呼……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她那一脸安心的睡脸，让人都不禁怀疑她是真的在害怕吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，换我没法睡了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉一翻身就会把她压扁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未身上散发着一股婴儿般的香味。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":1043,"value":["==",["v",6790],5]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为这种味道很少有机会闻到，所以感觉怪怪的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得……有些激动……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"娇小又脆弱，而又柔软――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哼！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"往自己脸上揍了一拳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"用蛮力将差点开启的新世界大门给关上了。"},{"op":"goto","target":1046},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是浴室的香皂味吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不可思议地使人平静，又有点怀念的味道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在羽未的身旁闭上了眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"细微的呼吸声如同摇篮曲，让我在不知不觉间也进入了梦乡。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在不知不觉间我的嗜好也扭曲了吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就因为在男校上学……身边也没有女孩子……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以将自己潜在的理想换成了小女孩……？”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":1071,"value":["==",["v",6790],5]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么嘛，其实我自己不是早就知道了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当羽未叫我萝莉控时……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我心中荡漾起的那份激动。”"},{"op":"goto","target":1071},{"op":"goto","target":290},{"op":"end"}]